WEBVTT

00:00:59.377 --> 00:01:02.467
(Applause and laughter)

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:06.107
SRK: Look ...
(Laughter)

00:01:07.717 --> 00:01:11.257
Before I start talking
with this wonderful innovator

00:01:11.257 --> 00:01:13.797
and one of the greatest people
from our country,

00:01:13.797 --> 00:01:15.667
I would like to thank you personally


00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:18.417
on behalf of all of us
who had come to your office.

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:19.827
Is everyone OK there?

00:01:19.827 --> 00:01:22.527
All those boys and girls 
were so warm and nice to us.

00:01:23.097 --> 00:01:25.650
SP: Everyone is OK.
They are still screaming for you

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:27.763
but I've never seen anything like that.

00:01:27.763 --> 00:01:29.007
They are all OK.

00:01:29.007 --> 00:01:32.417
SRK: OK. Thank you for being here
and on this Probot.